\title{EQMQ learnable}
\taxon{Definition}
\date{2026-01-15}
\author{JB00}
\import{macros}

\p{We say #{\mathcal{C}} is \em{EQMQ learnable} if there exists an algorithm such that for all #{c \in \mathcal{C}} the algorithm will return #{c} provided it is given access to MQ and EQ, in polynomial time.}
